1. ngspice (portions derived from; Modified BSD / BSD-3-Clause)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Portions of RSpice's device models and transient engine are derived from, or
ported by study of, source files of the ngspice circuit simulator
(https://ngspice.sourceforge.io/), version 46. All such files are part of
ngspice's Modified BSD ("New BSD") licensed code base. No code was taken from
ngspice's LGPL components (src/maths/KLU, src/frontend/numparam, tclspice),
its GPL component (src/xspice/icm/table), or its MPL component (src/osdi).

Derived components include:
  - BSIM3SOI DD/FD/PD MOSFET models (crates/rspice-core/src/device/mosfet/b3soi/)
    ported from ngspice src/spicelib/devices/bsim3soi_dd, bsim3soi_fd,
    bsim3soi_pd — Copyright 1990, 1999 Regents of the University of California.
    Authors: Samuel Fung, Dennis Sinitsky, Stephen Tang, Weidong Liu, Pin Su,
    and others.
  - Native BSIM4 v4.8 MOSFET model (crates/rspice-core/src/device/mosfet/bsim4v8/)
    ported from ngspice src/spicelib/devices/bsim4, which carries the UC
    Berkeley BSIM4 / Educational Community License notices described in
    section 2 below.
  - Coupled and lossy transmission-line convolution runtimes (CPL, TXL)
    (crates/rspice-core/src/device/cpl_native.rs,
    crates/rspice-core/src/device/transmission_line/txl.rs) ported from
    ngspice src/spicelib/devices/cpl and txl — Copyright 1992 Regents of the
    University of California. Author: Charles Hough.
  - LTRA lossy-line, JFET/MESFET/HFET, BJT/VBIC, and legacy MOS equation and
    algorithm portions modeled on ngspice src/spicelib/devices (ltra, jfet,
    mesa, hfet1, bjt, vbic, mos1/mos2/mos6, devsup.c) and transient analysis
    control modeled on src/spicelib/analysis (dctran.c) — Copyright
    1985-2018 Regents of the University of California and others; MESA model
    Copyright 1993 T. Ytterdal, K. Lee, M. Shur and T. A. Fjeldly.
  - Independent-source SFFM/AM waveform semantics from
    src/spicelib/devices/vsrc/vsrcload.c — Copyright 1990 Regents of the
    University of California.

